    "title": "Cole Kmet carted off field in Bears' game vs. Patriots - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James Neveau ,\n3 hours ago Chicago Bears tight end Cole Kmet was carted off the field after taking a hit to his legs in the fourth quarter of Thursday’s game against the New England Patriots. Kmet had caught a pass on second down from quarterback Caleb Williams and was moving toward the first-down marker when he was hit by two Patriots defenders. Read full article",
